# Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads BOM-less UTF-8 as the ANSI code page (GBK on
# Chinese Windows). .ps1 files are stored byte-for-byte as UTF-8 with BOM and
# CRLF; -text stops git from converting them on checkout or in archives.
*.ps1 -text
# Shell scripts must stay LF to run on macOS.
*.command text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
